---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Section from '../components/Section.astro';
import Button from '../components/Button.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="About | Professional Pathfinder 2E Game Master"
	description="Learn about our approach to Game Mastering, our philosophy on running inclusive and engaging Pathfinder 2E campaigns, and what makes our tables special."
>
	<!-- Hero Section -->
	<section class="relative bg-gradient-to-br from-[#fdf4f5] via-white to-[#f0fdfc] py-20 md:py-32">
		<div class="max-w-screen-xl mx-auto px-6">
			<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
				<h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-display font-bold mb-6">
					Bringing Stories
					<span class="block bg-gradient-to-r from-[#9c2d4b] to-[#107574] bg-clip-text text-transparent">
            To Life
          </span>
				</h1>
				<p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
					Professional Game Master dedicated to creating memorable Pathfinder 2E experiences for players of
					all backgrounds
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- My Approach -->
	<Section background="white" padding="xl">
		<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
			<h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-display text-center mb-12">My Approach</h2>

			<div class="prose prose-lg prose-stone mx-auto">
				<p class="text-xl leading-relaxed text-stone-700">
					I believe that tabletop RPGs are at their best when they bring people together to tell collaborative
					stories. Whether you're a complete newcomer curious about Pathfinder 2E or a veteran player seeking
					a new campaign, my goal is to create a welcoming space where everyone can contribute to something
					special.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mt-16">
				<div class="text-center">
					<div
						class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-4 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#b93d5e] to-[#9c2d4b] flex items-center justify-center text-white text-2xl">
						📚
					</div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-display font-semibold mb-2">Story First</h3>
					<p class="text-stone-600">
						Rich narratives with meaningful character arcs and player agency at the forefront
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="text-center">
					<div
						class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-4 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#107574] to-[#0d9390] flex items-center justify-center text-white text-2xl">
						🎲
					</div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-display font-semibold mb-2">Rules Support Story</h3>
					<p class="text-stone-600">
						Pathfinder 2E's tactical depth enhances drama without getting in the way
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="text-center">
					<div
						class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-4 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#d97706] to-[#f59e0b] flex items-center justify-center text-white text-2xl">
						🤝
					</div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-display font-semibold mb-2">Everyone Matters</h3>
					<p class="text-stone-600">
						Safe, inclusive tables where all players have space to shine
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</Section>

	<!-- Why Pathfinder 2E -->
	<Section background="stone" padding="xl">
		<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
			<h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-display text-center mb-12">Why Pathfinder 2E?</h2>

			<div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-12 border border-stone-200 space-y-6">
				<p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone-700">
					Pathfinder Second Edition strikes a perfect balance between tactical depth and narrative
					flexibility. The three-action system creates dynamic, engaging combat where every turn matters.
					Character customization is virtually limitless, allowing players to build the exact hero they
					envision.
				</p>

				<p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone-700">
					But what truly sets PF2E apart is how well it supports collaborative storytelling. The game gives
					GMs powerful tools to create challenges that feel fair yet epic, while giving players meaningful
					choices both in and out of combat.
				</p>

				<p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone-700">
					Whether we're running a published Adventure Path or a custom campaign, Pathfinder 2E provides the
					perfect foundation for memorable adventures.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</Section>

	<!-- Why Foundry VTT -->
	<Section background="white" padding="xl">
		<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
			<h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-display text-center mb-12">Why Foundry VTT?</h2>

			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
				<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-[#fbe8eb] to-[#fdf4f5] rounded-2xl p-8 border border-[#b93d5e]/20">
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-display font-semibold mb-4 text-stone-900">Browser-Based Convenience</h3>
					<p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
						No downloads, no installations—just click the link and you're at the table. Works on any laptop
						or computer with a web browser.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-[#f0fdfc] to-[#ccfbf8] rounded-2xl p-8 border border-[#107574]/20">
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-display font-semibold mb-4 text-stone-900">Powerful Automation</h3>
					<p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
						PF2E system automation handles complex rules, letting us focus on story and strategy instead of
						number crunching.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-[#fffbeb] to-[#fef3c7] rounded-2xl p-8 border border-[#d97706]/20">
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-display font-semibold mb-4 text-stone-900">Immersive Visuals</h3>
					<p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
						Dynamic lighting, animated tokens, and beautiful maps create a cinematic experience that rivals
						in-person play.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-[#faf5ff] to-[#f3e8ff] rounded-2xl p-8 border border-[#7c3aed]/20">
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-display font-semibold mb-4 text-stone-900">Infinite Customization</h3>
					<p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
						Modules, macros, and custom content let us tailor every campaign to create exactly the
						experience we want.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</Section>

	<!-- My Gaming Background -->
	<Section background="stone" padding="xl">
		<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
			<h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-display text-center mb-12">Gaming Background</h2>

			<div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-12 border border-stone-200">
				<div class="prose prose-lg prose-stone mx-auto">
					<p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone-700">
						I've been playing tabletop RPGs for almost a decade, with experience in D&D 5E and Pathfinder 2E.
						When I decided to run my first campaign I went with Pathfinder's beginner box and I've been hooked
						ever since.
					</p>

					<p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone-700">
						As a GM, I've run campaigns ranging from epic 1-20 Adventure Paths to intimate custom
						storylines. I've learned that the best sessions happen when players feel invested in both their
						characters and the world around them—and that's what I strive to create at every table.
					</p>

					<p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone-700">
						Outside of gaming, I'm passionate about technology, storytelling, and building inclusive
						communities. These interests all feed back into creating better game experiences.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</Section>

	<!-- Table Culture -->
	<Section background="white" padding="xl">
		<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
			<h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-display text-center mb-12">Table Culture & Expectations</h2>

			<div class="space-y-6">
				<div class="flex gap-4 items-start">
					<div
						class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#b93d5e] flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold flex-shrink-0">
						✓
					</div>
					<div class="flex-1">
						<h3 class="text-xl font-display font-semibold mb-2">Inclusive & Respectful</h3>
						<p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
							All players are welcome regardless of experience level, background, or identity. We maintain
							a harassment-free environment where everyone feels safe.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="flex gap-4 items-start">
					<div
						class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#b93d5e] flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold flex-shrink-0">
						✓
					</div>
					<div class="flex-1">
						<h3 class="text-xl font-display font-semibold mb-2">Collaborative Storytelling</h3>
						<p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
							The best stories emerge from player choices. I create frameworks and NPCs, but you shape the
							narrative through your actions and decisions.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="flex gap-4 items-start">
					<div
						class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#b93d5e] flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold flex-shrink-0">
						✓
					</div>
					<div class="flex-1">
						<h3 class="text-xl font-display font-semibold mb-2">Rules as Guidelines</h3>
						<p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
							I know the rules well, but I'm not rigid about them. If a rule gets in the way of fun or
							story, we'll find a solution together. <em>rule of cool</em>
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="flex gap-4 items-start">
					<div
						class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#b93d5e] flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold flex-shrink-0">
						✓
					</div>
					<div class="flex-1">
						<h3 class="text-xl font-display font-semibold mb-2">Spotlight Sharing</h3>
						<p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
							Every character gets their moment to shine. Combat encounters, social scenes, and
							exploration all provide opportunities for different party members to excel.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="flex gap-4 items-start">
					<div
						class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#b93d5e] flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold flex-shrink-0">
						✓
					</div>
					<div class="flex-1">
						<h3 class="text-xl font-display font-semibold mb-2">Communication is Key</h3>
						<p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
							Questions, concerns, or feedback are always welcome. If something isn't working for you,
							let's talk about it and find a solution.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="flex gap-4 items-start">
					<div
						class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#b93d5e] flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold flex-shrink-0">
						✓
					</div>
					<div class="flex-1">
						<h3 class="text-xl font-display font-semibold mb-2">Fail forward</h3>
						<p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
							I might be playing the bad guys, but that doesn't mean I'm not on the players' side!
							I'll cheer your wins and groan when you roll that <kbd>1</kbd> with you.
							Even failure isn't the end of the story, just another story beat.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</Section>

	<!-- CTA Section -->
	<Section background="gradient" padding="xl">
		<div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto">
			<h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-display mb-6">Ready to Adventure Together?</h2>
			<p class="text-xl text-stone-600 mb-8">
				Browse available campaigns or reach out to discuss custom options
			</p>
			<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
				<Button variant="primary" href="/campaigns" size="lg">View Campaigns</Button>
				<Button variant="outline" href="/contact" size="lg">Get in Touch</Button>
			</div>
		</div>
	</Section>
</BaseLayout>
